    "slug": "anc302-flm-thi-2",
    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Assessment 2 (Assessment 2.1 and Assessment 2.2) 30.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANC302 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Assessment 2 (Assessment 2.1 and Assessment 2.2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13434 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANC302 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Assessment 2 (Assessment 2.1 and Assessment 2.2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13434 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">1 assignment/<br>18 sessions/ in class and at home</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3,CLO5,CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Students are required to submit a PDF report that includes:<br>Assignment 2.1<br>1. Three detailed costume sketches for each character.<br>2. Three detailed facial sketches for each character.<br>3. An additional report describing the use of AI support, if applicable.<br>Assignment 2.2<br>- A complete report on the process of comparison, evaluation, and revision to produce the best thumbnail</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Design rough representations</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">- Assessment Regulations<br>- Displayed and evaluated by students first, then evaluated and graded by lecturer.<br>- Guided by instructor<br>-AI Usage Regulations<br>+ Students are allowed to use any generative AI tools to search for secondary data and generate ideas. However, they must independently construct the final product in accordance with the conditions and requirements of the assignment.<br>+ Students must submit an AI usage report describing the process, including screenshots that illustrate the steps taken.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Task<br>- Assessment 2.1: Students must create three preliminary sketches in a 3/4 view for each character and submit the process of developing these sketches<br>- Assessment 2.2: 'Students compare, evaluate, and refine their work to produce the best design sketch.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
