    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANC302 · Assessment 4/6</span>\n<h2>Assessment 4 (Assessment 4.1 and Assessment 4.2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13434 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANC302 · Đầu điểm 4/6</span>\n<h2>Assessment 4 (Assessment 4.1 and Assessment 4.2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13434 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">1 assignment/<br>9 sessions/ in class and at home</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Students are required to submit a PDF report that includes:<br>Assignment 4.1:<br>1. Reference materials.<br>2. Six emotional expression sketches for each character.<br>3. An additional report describing the use of AI support, if applicable<br>Assignment 4.2:<br>1. Reference materials.<br>2. Skeleton sketches of six action poses for each character.<br>3. Detailed sketches of six action poses for each character.<br>4. An additional report describing the use of AI support, if applicable</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Action and facial expressions</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">- Displayed and evaluated by students first, then evaluated and graded by lecturer.<br>- Guided by instructor<br>-AI Usage Regulations<br>+ Students are allowed to use any generative AI tools to search for secondary data and generate ideas. However, they must independently construct the final product in accordance with the conditions and requirements of the assignment.<br>+ Students must submit an AI usage report describing the process, including screenshots that illustrate the steps taken.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Task<br>- Assessment 4.1: Students must conduct research and direct observation, or use AI to generate visual reference images, in order to sketch six emotional expressions that are consistent with the character’s personality and the storyline<br>- Assessment 4.2: 'Students must refer to action images or videos, or use AI to generate visual reference images, in order to sketch the character in six appropriate action poses</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
